---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About – Bye Donald">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-12">
    <div class="py-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
        About ByeDonald.com
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        This project is an open-source effort to track and categorize news
        related to Donald Trump's second term as President. It aims to provide a
        factual, day-by-day overview of events as reported by various news
        outlets.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
        How It Works
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        The content on this site is generated through a fully automated pipeline
        that ensures daily updates and consistent categorization.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 text-left md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold">1. Fetch News</h3>
          <p class="m-0 text-muted-foreground">
            Every day, a script fetches the latest news articles related to
            Donald Trump from a variety of sources using the GNews.io API.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold">2. Tag Articles</h3>
          <p class="m-0 text-muted-foreground">
            Each article is then processed by Anthropic's Claude AI model, which
            reads the content and assigns relevant tags to categorize the news.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold">3. Index for Search</h3>
          <p class="m-0 text-muted-foreground">
            All tagged articles are sent to Algolia, which powers the fast and
            accurate search functionality you can use across the site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 rounded-lg bg-muted/50 px-6 py-10 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
        Acknowledgements &amp; Technology
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        This project would not be possible without several key services and
        open-source technologies.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6">
        <a
          href="https://gnews.io/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >GNews.io</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://www.anthropic.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >Anthropic Claude</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://www.algolia.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >Algolia</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://astro.build/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >Astro</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://ui.shadcn.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >shadcn/ui</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold text-blue-600 no-underline hover:underline dark:text-blue-400"
          >TypeScript</a
        >
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
        Open Source
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        This entire project is open source. You can view the code, report issues,
        or contribute on GitHub.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/cloudy-native/byedonald.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white no-underline transition hover:bg-blue-800"
      >
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
